# The locks job's tools: livingproof v1.4.9 and capability-verifier v1.10.0, pinned by commit
# (git installs cannot carry a hash; the commit is the content pin). Every other requirement
# is hashed in lock-check.txt. Regenerate with:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 --no-header \
#     .github/requirements/lock-check.in -o .github/requirements/lock-check.txt
